@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This is a demo application. It is not a commercial service.</p>

<h2 class="h4">What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not ask for personal data. There is no sign up, no login and no contact form.</p>
<p>
    The web server keeps short technical logs (such as the IP address and the time of a request) to
    keep the app running and to fix errors. We do not use these logs to identify people.
</p>

<h2 class="h4">Cookies</h2>
<p>
    We do not use cookies for tracking or advertising. The framework may set a technical cookie to
    protect forms against abuse. It is not shared with anyone.
</p>

<h2 class="h4">Third parties</h2>
<p>
    The application is hosted on Microsoft Azure, which processes requests on our behalf. We do not
    sell or share data with anyone else.
</p>

<h2 class="h4">Your rights</h2>
<p>
    If you have a question about this policy, or you want your data removed, open an issue in the
    project repository and we will answer it.
</p>

<p class="text-muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>
